0afbee5e8ced061cc31fd9b39e82f0", "message": "Merge branch 'Sauvegarde'", "created_at": "2023-11-23T16:41:21Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab30c6ad79115e303f7f10feb428edaa5907079f", "message": "Compl\u00e9tion de l'affichage entier d'un niveau. On va \u00e0 pr\u00e9sent se charger de faire la charge d'une partie sauvegard\u00e9e.", "created_at": "2023-11-23T16:39:09Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bb4ceb27d409ca8c53947efa9b677ec86cd705a4", "message": "Correction du temps \u00e9coul\u00e9.", "created_at": "2023-11-23T12:46:17Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a329c774ae41edfc70950d14c2a57d2428d82f4", "message": "Impl\u00e9mentation d'un \"game over\" si le temps est \u00e9coul\u00e9 et qu'il ne reste plus assez de vies.", "created_at": "2023-11-23T11:15:37Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b5b5b5a1d1f8831a842386fbaf5094ae3afa6a7a", "message": "Rempla\u00e7age de la donnee du temps restant par celle d\u00e9j\u00e0 contenue dans la structure plateau. Cela facilite les choses et permet de stocker le temps en donnee.", "created_at": "2023-11-23T10:50:49Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f18a3374ad132b7d94177fc1ff565433a02a69ee", "message": "Correction de la pause.", "created_at": "2023-11-23T10:41:08Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1070496d6168beb4aeafb97e7da642a616b5a96d", "message": "Affiche int\u00e9gral du temps restant. D\u00e9but d'affichage des autres donn\u00e9es. Le menu pause (touche 'k') arr\u00eate le compteur, et le reprend lorsqu'on r\u00e9appuie sur 'k' (pause)", "created_at": "2023-11-23T10:36:08Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c88902ca4a44c6720a188714e59258c794c1a7df", "message": "Int\u00e9gration du module de temps de Franklin dans le jeu principal. Le compteur s'affiche ind\u00e9pendamment du plateau et se reset lorsqu'on passe au niveau suivant/recommence une partie.", "created_at": "2023-11-23T10:05:07Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d450b85ca8a496fc7037dc8ad6fefa125fa50f68", "message": "Correction de bug movesnoopy.", "created_at": "2023-11-23T07:45:23Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b4b469c0697aff89bc8ef51207a9dae950337b44", "message": "Fonction jouer : on peut sauvegarder le programme \u00e0 tout moment et le quitter avec les touches 'l' et 'm'. Il peut passer au niveau suivant (dans l'option 2) avec la touche 'c'. Tout cela est valable dans les options 2 et 4 du menu (partie enti\u00e8re ou simple niveau).", "created_at": "2023-11-22T12:20:47Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4e8e02ce778fa2c74ed031f56e30a9d089293719", "message": "Modification des mots de passe et des messages li\u00e9s aux mots de passe (comme les erreurs).", "created_at": "2023-11-22T11:36:32Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c92bb76d39da1cef2fd48457a7a321c2bf56ac55", "message": "Fluidification du menu : un seul plateau par partie mis \u00e0 jour au fur et \u00e0 mesure des niveaux. Squelette cr\u00e9er pour les fonctions de jeu.", "created_at": "2023-11-22T11:32:34Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b7b8dcec85fcea0c615145fe0433843fbf20df2f", "message": "Restructuration : Fonctions de sauvegarde mises dans Gestion_des_sauvegardes.c.", "created_at": "2023-11-22T11:01:33Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "81cfc0d1316fe20b71a6f2a313fe979fc7fda238", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/Sauvegarde' into Sauvegarde", "created_at": "2023-11-22T10:17:03Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4a67d2d4c0c09df9be7f7327f217e1d668ad9194", "message": "Compl\u00e9tion de la fonction de lecture de sauvegarde. Toutes les donn\u00e9es \u00e9crites sont enregistr\u00e9es auparavant sont \u00e9crites dans le plateau appel\u00e9 par pointeur. Il faut \u00e0 pr\u00e9sent impl\u00e9menter les actions de sauvegarde avec le menu.", "created_at": "2023-11-22T10:16:42Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e139b84a10663b394c2498b7080731c43ec3f1c", "message": "Autres parametres mis dans la structure Plateau : Nom, scores, position Snoopy, etc. Fonction d'\u00e9criture de sauvegarde compl\u00e9t\u00e9e.", "created_at": "2023-11-22T10:14:34Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95d8cbfc3dadf5514ffa6c778c5884636359582e", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/Sauvegarde' into Sauvegarde\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tGestion_des_sauvegardes.h\n#\tMartin_espace_de_travail.c\n#\tmain.c", "created_at": "2023-11-22T09:48:43Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b19f9868402394179b644ee882373577cbf539e0", "message": "Autres parametres mis dans la structure Plateau : Nom, scores, position Snoopy, etc. Fonction d'\u00e9criture de sauvegarde compl\u00e9t\u00e9e.", "created_at": "2023-11-22T09:46:46Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "43ed4aa314a6bf9c5b7289aaed4a1580f577993d", "message": "Cr\u00e9ation des fonctions basiques li\u00e9es \u00e0 la sauvegarde des fichiers. L'utilisateur rentre un nom et \u00e9crit, lit ou supprime un fichier de sauvegarde.", "created_at": "2023-11-22T08:46:15Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c6640b2207f552701c78138081b0fe87c250994d", "message": "Restructuration des sous-programmes localis\u00e9s dans \"Martin_Espace_de_travail\".", "created_at": "2023-11-22T08:40:12Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e684b0ad08d760a196517ccbace68571efc578b8", "message": "Restructuration des sous-programmes localis\u00e9s dans \"Martin_Espace_de_travail\".", "created_at": "2023-11-19T18:57:00Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8d8a42469f8b32b1afe55e80f00b345515578f15", "message": "Corrige bug 1", "created_at": "2023-11-18T20:19:41Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4180aad077ad3cb468fc30cbb93f8e79bff3b47e", "message": "Les designs des 4 niveaux est termin\u00e9. On peut charge un niveau avec un mdp. Il faut maintenant g\u00e9rer le jeu.", "created_at": "2023-11-17T11:28:01Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8d40033fe68f05ee3cea73867eb4e20ab015af53", "message": "Test de la fonction gotoligcol + system(\"cls\")", "created_at": "2023-11-16T16:29:29Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74bba55e368efdbcf2b3a5c9d8bd4b2569ba1020", "message": "Cr\u00e9ation de la biblioth\u00e8que Chargement_Niveaux.h. Fonction menu d\u00e9plac\u00e9e vers cette derni\u00e8re, comparaison des mots de passe.", "created_at": "2023-11-16T14:45:26Z", "repo": "Projet_Snoopy", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "40bc480718bbc4386f57f7eba66a17913a91da27", "messa